          "short": "$x=-7$ or $1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x^{2}+30x-35&=0\\\\5(x^{2}+6x-7)&=0\\\\5(x+7)(x-1)&=0\\\\x&=-7\\text{ or }1\\end{align*}$$",
